1 NOTE {geni:about_me} C. G. Tregard (b.20 Nov 1717 Synnerby, Sweden, d.19 Jul 1767 Cape colony, South Africa) was the son of Jacob Trägårdh, captain of the cavalry, Sweden, and Maria Elisabet Soop. He arrived in the Cape in 1742 as an e
2 CONC mployee of the V.O.C., a so-called "vlaggeman" or flag officer, and later became a free citizen at Stellenbosch.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.openarch.nl/ghn:e243eb60-06c7-40b6-ad56-90f0e9edfea6 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Susanna Kuun on 11 Oct 1744 with whom he had two children, 
2 CONT * Jacobus Gustavus (1745–1818) and 
2 CONT * Carolus Johannes (b.24-7-1753), who was the father of voortrekker Louis Tregardt.
2 CONT
2 CONT Carl Gustav Tregard van Uddevalle in Swede.  Stamvader van die Triegaardt familie. Aankoms omstreeks 1742. "Vlaggeman" HOIK Oorlede 19/09/1767. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Die grootvader van Louis Triegaardt - Voortrekkerleier.
